|CKBDruid|000

|CK0Druids are warrior-priests of Gaea who combine elemental invocations,
prepared rituals, Sacred Groves, companions, and gathered materials. Their
magic changes with terrain, planets, moons, and the natural world around them.|000

|CKBHow it plays|000
|CK0Invocations spend four Nwyfre currents: Tellurian, Daloan, Marken, and
Tekali. Rituals restore or reshape those currents, while mastery improves each
learned invocation. A Druid also gathers herbs, creature reagents, skins, ores,
and special materials for rituals and companions.|000

|CKBCore skills|000
|CK0spirit aura is an early invocation; entangle, frostbolt, lightning,
flameblade, renewal, and earthmeld show the elemental range. Grove plant creates
a personal wilderness sanctuary, commune returns to it, ritual prepares longer
effects, and companions add animal allies.|000

|CKBBest fit|000
|CK0Choose Druid if you want a deep hybrid with multiple resources, preparation,
world-sensitive magic, gathering, and a permanent place in the wilderness.
The guild rewards planning more than a fixed spell rotation.|000

|CK0After joining, begin with |CKBdhelp beginner|CK0, then explore
|CKBdhelp nwyfre|CK0, |CKBdhelp ritual|CK0, and |CKBdhelp grove|CK0.|000

